<title>GREECE: Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 13.15 from 13.16 percent.</title>
<headline>Greek 1M ATHIBOR eases to 13.15 from 13.16 percent.</headline>
<dateline>ATHENS 1996-08-28</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Athens Interbank Offered Rate (Athibor) for one month slipped to 13.15 from 13.16 percent and the bid rate (Athibid) fell to 12.66 percent from 12.68 percent.</p>
